    {
      "id": "p0-title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Phase 0 simulation roadmap\nBuild one auditable basketball simulator in measured steps. Follow the arrows; each completed phase leaves evidence.",
      "x": -650,
      "y": -750,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0-a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 0A ✅ ENGINE\nDeterministic resolver\n• legal action contract\n• decision tape + events\n• exact replay",
      "x": -650,
      "y": -540,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0-b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 0B ✅ CALIBRATION\n1,000 reproducible games\n• team + player metrics\n• realism guardrails\n• rebound bug corrected",
      "x": -180,
      "y": -540,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0-c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 0C ✅ AI GUARDRAIL\nLegal actions only\n• strict JSON validation\n• deterministic fallback\n• exact recorded replay",
      "x": 290,
      "y": -540,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0-d",
